{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02FE70","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"<R=蛤蟆,索摩查>一家掌控尼加拉瓜，已经有40年了。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=蛤蟆,索摩查>","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":"RUBY_INSULT_WORDPLAY_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"他们仗着<R=国民警卫队,Guardia>，想干什么就干什么。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=国民警卫队,Guardia>","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_LATIN_READING;JPN_DO_AS_THEY_PLEASE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"你们也是被<R=国民警卫队,Guardia>追赶，才逃到<R=这里,哥斯达黎加>来的吧。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=国民警卫队,Guardia> <R=这里,哥斯达黎加>","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED;COSTA_RICA_READING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"对。他们夺走了一切。土地、房子、工作……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"都成索摩查的了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":"JPN_QUESTION_TONE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"对，连法律也是。法官都被收买了。反抗就会被杀。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"大家都得看<R=国民警卫队,Guardia>的脸色活着。即便这样，只要他们心情不好，照样会挨打。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=国民警卫队,Guardia>","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_LATIN_READING"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"所以你们才想改变这个国家？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"JPN_QUESTION_TONE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不只是这样。索摩查一直利用手中的权力中饱私囊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"他们没收别人的土地，变成家族的财产。如今全国近一半的农地都落到了索摩查一家手里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"我们什么也做不了。但是……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"AUX_UNTIL_PARAPHRASE_REPLACED_BY_JPN"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"你知道两年前那场地震吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":"JPN_KNOW_NOT_REMEMBER_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"嗯。听说直接袭击了首都。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"我们失去了首都马那瓜。世界各地的人都送来了援助物资。我们高兴得都快流泪了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":"AUX_AID_AND_TEAR_DETAIL_REJOINED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"可索摩查却侵吞了绝大多数援助。他们还把这些物资卖给那些在地震中失去一切的人，向他们收钱！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":"AUX_EMBEZZLEMENT_AND_RESALE_REJOINED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"那些家伙竟然拿自己国家的不幸牟利！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":"JPN_EXPLOITATION_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"国民的愤怒已经到了顶点。他们的末日很快就要到了。不，是我们会亲手终结他们。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":"AUX_FINAL_RESOLVE_RESTORED"}]}